grouping-sets off		3
-- a CONSTANT GROUP BY key makes the whole query decline. The planner drops such a key when the
-- query has aggregates, and whether it does so also depends on initiator-vs-shard flags this
-- pass cannot read, so the key count the grouping conditional is built from would be too large
-- and the conditional would mis-decide present-vs-absent. Declining matches master, which skips
-- the whole modifier family. Each shape is paired with its optimization-disabled oracle.
